# wording
\(ULID or IRI\) => (UUIDv7 or IRI)
= ULID of the \*\*root post\*\* => = UUIDv7 of the **root post**
`id` \(ULID\) => `id` (UUIDv7)
internally ULID\b => internally UUIDv7 (RFC 9562)
Internal ID \| ULID \(opaque, sortable\) => Internal ID | UUIDv7 (RFC 9562, time-sortable)
internally a ULID, externally => internally a UUIDv7 (RFC 9562), externally
<domain>/<ulid> => <domain>/<uuid>
\(ULID\) \| => (UUIDv7) |
an internal ULID\b => an internal UUIDv7
the ULID the stable identity => the UUIDv7 the stable identity
/<ulid>` => /<uuid>`
`<type>_<ulid>` => `<type>_<uuid>` (UUIDv7)
